WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.815
Step 1. Open the Book Appointment sheet.

1.2
00:00:02.815 --> 00:00:07.048
You book an appointment for a patient in a slot of a practitioner,

1.3
00:00:07.048 --> 00:00:09.292
a location or a healthcare service.

1.4
00:00:09.292 --> 00:00:14.602
Search for the patient, open Patient Home, and select Schedule Appointment.

2.1
00:00:14.602 --> 00:00:17.075
Step 2. Choose the resource type.

2.2
00:00:17.075 --> 00:00:22.464
Under Select resource type, select Practitioner, Location or Healthcare Service.

2.3
00:00:22.464 --> 00:00:27.005
Care remembers the type that you chose last in this browser.

3.1
00:00:27.005 --> 00:00:31.688
Step 3. Choose the practitioner, location or healthcare service.

3.2
00:00:31.688 --> 00:00:37.161
Open Select Practitioner. The list shows the practitioners of your departments.

3.3
00:00:37.161 --> 00:00:41.401
Here you select General Medicine, then Dr. Meera Iyer.

4.1
00:00:41.401 --> 00:00:46.566
Step 4. Add tags and a reason for the visit. Both fields are optional.

4.2
00:00:46.566 --> 00:00:49.094
Type the reason in Reason for visit.

4.3
00:00:49.094 --> 00:00:52.964
Care saves the reason as the appointment's note.

5.1
00:00:52.964 --> 00:00:58.751
Step 5. Choose a date. Each day that has free places shows how many are left.

5.2
00:00:58.751 --> 00:01:03.426
You cannot select a day before today, a day that is fully booked,

5.3
00:01:03.426 --> 00:01:05.580
or a day without slots.

6.1
00:01:05.580 --> 00:01:10.372
Step 6. Choose a slot. The slots are grouped under their session name,

6.2
00:01:10.372 --> 00:01:13.616
and each shows its start time and the places left.

6.3
00:01:13.616 --> 00:01:18.659
Care selects the first available slot; select another if you need one.

7.1
00:01:18.659 --> 00:01:22.934
Step 7. Confirm the appointment. Select Confirm Appointment.

7.2
00:01:22.934 --> 00:01:27.898
Care shows Appointment created successfully and opens Appointment Details.

7.3
00:01:27.898 --> 00:01:33.362
The new appointment has the status Booked and takes one place in the slot.
